  "reflection": "This group consisted entirely of qualitative nucleic acid amplification tests (`-Nho`). The `has_property` (`Presence or Threshold`) and `has_method` (`Nucleic acid amplification with probe detection`) were consistent and correct across the board. The `has_system` axis was also correctly inferred from the test code prefixes (`f-`, `li-`, `s-`) in the prior pass, requiring no changes. \n\nThe main corrections involved the `has_component` axis for four coronavirus tests (rows 1153-1156). The original values, e.g., `Coronavirus 229E`, were near-misses; I corrected them to the exact OMOP terms, `Human coronavirus 229E`, as suggested by the candidate list. This is a perfect example of the value of this correction step. Rows flagged as panels (`is_panel: true`) correctly had their component axes left empty, as did one row with an ambiguous test code (`-bopanho`), which I left unchanged."
